  "source": "AACAP, Walter et al., Clinical Practice Guideline for the Assessment and Treatment of Children and Adolescents With Anxiety Disorders, JAACAP 2020;59(10):1107-1124, https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32439401/ (texto integral lido numa cópia PDF alojada em njaap.org; o site da JAACAP devolve 403) (Treatment Statement 4, Implementation); RCM Venlafaxina Desinax aprovado pelo Infarmed em 15-12-2020, https://www.tecnimede.com/sites/default/files/portfolio/dosages/VENLAFAXINA%20DESINAX_RCM.pdf; RCM Duloxetina Farmoz 60 mg aprovado pelo Infarmed em 10-12-2021, https://www.tecnimede.com/sites/default/files/portfolio/dosages/DULOXETINA%20FARMOZ%2060MG_RCM.pdf (extração do PDF degradada; confirmei a frase sobre menores de 18 anos)"
